        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="1%E6%A0%87%E9%A2%98"><a id="1%E6%A0%87%E9%A2%98" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#1%E6%A0%87%E9%A2%98"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>1. 标题</h2><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown"># 一级标题## 二级标题### 三级标题#### 四级标题##### 五级标题###### 六级标题</code></pre><p>效果：</p><h1 id="%E4%B8%80%E7%BA%A7%E6%A0%87%E9%A2%98"><a id="%E4%B8%80%E7%BA%A7%E6%A0%87%E9%A2%98" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#%E4%B8%80%E7%BA%A7%E6%A0%87%E9%A2%98"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>一级标题</h1><h2 id="%E4%BA%8C%E7%BA%A7%E6%A0%87%E9%A2%98"><a id="%E4%BA%8C%E7%BA%A7%E6%A0%87%E9%A2%98" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#%E4%BA%8C%E7%BA%A7%E6%A0%87%E9%A2%98"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>二级标题</h2><h3 id="%E4%B8%89%E7%BA%A7%E6%A0%87%E9%A2%98"><a id="%E4%B8%89%E7%BA%A7%E6%A0%87%E9%A2%98" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#%E4%B8%89%E7%BA%A7%E6%A0%87%E9%A2%98"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>三级标题</h3><hr><h1 id="2%E5%AD%97%E4%BD%93"><a id="2%E5%AD%97%E4%BD%93" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#2%E5%AD%97%E4%BD%93"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>2. 字体</h1><h2 id="%E5%8A%A0%E7%B2%97"><a id="%E5%8A%A0%E7%B2%97" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#%E5%8A%A0%E7%B2%97"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>加粗</h2><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">**加粗文字**</code></pre><p>效果：</p><p><strong>加粗文字</strong></p><h2 id="%E6%96%9C%E4%BD%93"><a id="%E6%96%9C%E4%BD%93" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#%E6%96%9C%E4%BD%93"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>斜体</h2><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">*斜体文字*</code></pre><p>效果：</p><p><em>斜体文字</em></p><h2 id="%E5%8A%A0%E7%B2%97%E6%96%9C%E4%BD%93"><a id="%E5%8A%A0%E7%B2%97%E6%96%9C%E4%BD%93" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#%E5%8A%A0%E7%B2%97%E6%96%9C%E4%BD%93"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>加粗斜体</h2><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">***加粗斜体***</code></pre><p>效果：</p><p><em><strong>加粗斜体</strong></em></p><h2 id="%E5%88%A0%E9%99%A4%E7%BA%BF"><a id="%E5%88%A0%E9%99%A4%E7%BA%BF" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#%E5%88%A0%E9%99%A4%E7%BA%BF"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>删除线</h2><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">~~删除文字~~</code></pre><p>效果：</p><p><del>删除文字</del></p><hr><h1 id="3%E5%88%86%E5%89%B2%E7%BA%BF"><a id="3%E5%88%86%E5%89%B2%E7%BA%BF" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#3%E5%88%86%E5%89%B2%E7%BA%BF"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>3. 分割线</h1><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">---***___</code></pre><p>效果：</p><hr><hr><h1 id="4%E5%BC%95%E7%94%A8"><a id="4%E5%BC%95%E7%94%A8" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#4%E5%BC%95%E7%94%A8"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>4. 引用</h1><h2 id="%E4%B8%80%E7%BA%A7%E5%BC%95%E7%94%A8"><a id="%E4%B8%80%E7%BA%A7%E5%BC%95%E7%94%A8" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#%E4%B8%80%E7%BA%A7%E5%BC%95%E7%94%A8"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>一级引用</h2><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">&gt; 这是引用内容</code></pre><p>效果：</p><blockquote><p>这是引用内容</p></blockquote><h2 id="%E5%A4%9A%E7%BA%A7%E5%BC%95%E7%94%A8"><a id="%E5%A4%9A%E7%BA%A7%E5%BC%95%E7%94%A8" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#%E5%A4%9A%E7%BA%A7%E5%BC%95%E7%94%A8"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>多级引用</h2><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">&gt; 一级引用&gt;&gt;&gt; 二级引用&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; 三级引用</code></pre><hr><h1 id="5%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8"><a id="5%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#5%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>5. 列表</h1><h2 id="%E6%97%A0%E5%BA%8F%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8"><a id="%E6%97%A0%E5%BA%8F%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#%E6%97%A0%E5%BA%8F%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>无序列表</h2><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">- 苹果- 香蕉- 西瓜</code></pre><p>效果：</p><ul><li>苹果</li><li>香蕉</li><li>西瓜</li></ul><h2 id="%E5%A4%9A%E7%BA%A7%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8"><a id="%E5%A4%9A%E7%BA%A7%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#%E5%A4%9A%E7%BA%A7%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>多级列表</h2><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">- 一级  - 二级    - 三级</code></pre><h2 id="%E6%9C%89%E5%BA%8F%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8"><a id="%E6%9C%89%E5%BA%8F%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#%E6%9C%89%E5%BA%8F%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>有序列表</h2><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">1. 第一项2. 第二项3. 第三项</code></pre><h2 id="%E6%B7%B7%E5%90%88%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8"><a id="%E6%B7%B7%E5%90%88%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#%E6%B7%B7%E5%90%88%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>混合列表</h2><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">1. Linux   - Ubuntu   - CentOS2. Windows   - Windows10   - Windows11</code></pre><hr><h1 id="6%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8"><a id="6%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#6%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>6. 任务列表</h1><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">- [x] 完成安装- [ ] 配置环境- [ ] 发布博客</code></pre><p>效果：</p><ul><li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" checked="" disabled=""> 完成安装</li><li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" disabled=""> 配置环境</li><li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" disabled=""> 发布博客</li></ul><hr><h1 id="7%E9%93%BE%E6%8E%A5"><a id="7%E9%93%BE%E6%8E%A5" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#7%E9%93%BE%E6%8E%A5"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>7. 链接</h1><h2 id="%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E9%93%BE%E6%8E%A5"><a id="%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E9%93%BE%E6%8E%A5" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E9%93%BE%E6%8E%A5"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>普通链接</h2><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">[百度](https://www.baidu.com)</code></pre><h2 id="%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E9%93%BE%E6%8E%A5"><a id="%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E9%93%BE%E6%8E%A5" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E9%93%BE%E6%8E%A5"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>自动链接</h2><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">&lt;https://www.baidu.com&gt;</code></pre><hr><h1 id="8%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87"><a id="8%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#8%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>8. 图片</h1><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">![图片名称](图片地址)</code></pre><p>示例：</p><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">![Markdown](https://markdown-here.com/img/icon256.png)</code></pre><hr><h1 id="9%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC"><a id="9%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#9%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>9. 表格</h1><h2 id="%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC"><a id="%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>普通表格</h2><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">| 名称 | 类型 | 描述 || ---- | ---- | ---- || CPU | 硬件 | 处理器 || GPU | 硬件 | 显卡 |</code></pre><p>效果：</p><table><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>类型</th><th>描述</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>CPU</td><td>硬件</td><td>处理器</td></tr><tr><td>GPU</td><td>硬件</td><td>显卡</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="%E5%AF%B9%E9%BD%90%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC"><a id="%E5%AF%B9%E9%BD%90%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#%E5%AF%B9%E9%BD%90%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>对齐表格</h2><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">| 参数 | 值 || :--- | ---: || CPU | 32核 || 内存 | 128G |</code></pre><p>效果：</p><table><thead><tr><th style="text-align: left">参数</th><th style="text-align: right">值</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="text-align: left">CPU</td><td style="text-align: right">32核</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align: left">内存</td><td style="text-align: right">128G</td></tr></tbody></table><hr><h1 id="10%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81"><a id="10%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#10%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>10. 代码</h1><h2 id="%E8%A1%8C%E5%86%85%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81"><a id="%E8%A1%8C%E5%86%85%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#%E8%A1%8C%E5%86%85%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>行内代码</h2><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">使用 `docker ps` 查看容器</code></pre><p>效果：</p><p>使用 <code>docker ps</code> 查看容器</p><h2 id="%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E5%9D%97"><a id="%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E5%9D%97" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E5%9D%97"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>代码块</h2><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash">docker psdocker images</code></pre><p>支持：</p><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="text"><code class="language-text">bashpythonjavajavascriptjsonyamlsqldockerfilexmlnginx</code></pre><hr><h1 id="11-json%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B"><a id="11-json%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#11-json%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>11. JSON示例</h1><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="json"><code class="language-json">&#123;  "name": "ChatGPT",  "version": "1.0",  "enabled": true&#125;</code></pre><hr><h1 id="12-yaml%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B"><a id="12-yaml%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#12-yaml%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>12. YAML示例</h1><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="yaml"><code class="language-yaml">server:  port: 8080database:  host: localhost  username: root</code></pre><hr><h1 id="13-python%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B"><a id="13-python%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#13-python%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>13. Python示例</h1><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="python"><code class="language-python">def hello():    print("Hello Markdown")    hello()</code></pre><hr><h1 id="14-latex%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%A6%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F"><a id="14-latex%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%A6%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#14-latex%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%A6%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>14. LaTeX数学公式</h1><h2 id="%E8%A1%8C%E5%86%85%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F"><a id="%E8%A1%8C%E5%86%85%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#%E8%A1%8C%E5%86%85%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>行内公式</h2><p class="mweb-math-inline">\(a+b=c\)</p><h2 id="%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F"><a id="%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>独立公式</h2><div class="mweb-math-block">\[E=mc^2\]</div><h2 id="%E5%A4%8D%E6%9D%82%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F"><a id="%E5%A4%8D%E6%9D%82%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#%E5%A4%8D%E6%9D%82%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>复杂公式</h2><div class="mweb-math-block">\[\frac{-b\pm\sqrt{b^2-4ac}}{2a}\]</div><hr><h1 id="15-html"><a id="15-html" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#15-html"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>15. HTML</h1><h2 id="%E4%B8%8B%E5%88%92%E7%BA%BF"><a id="%E4%B8%8B%E5%88%92%E7%BA%BF" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#%E4%B8%8B%E5%88%92%E7%BA%BF"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>下划线</h2><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="html"><code class="language-html">&lt;u&gt;下划线文字&lt;/u&gt;</code></pre><h2 id="%E9%A2%9C%E8%89%B2"><a id="%E9%A2%9C%E8%89%B2" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#%E9%A2%9C%E8%89%B2"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>颜色</h2><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="html"><code class="language-html">&lt;span style="color:red"&gt;红色文字&lt;/span&gt;</code></pre><h2 id="%E5%B1%85%E4%B8%AD"><a id="%E5%B1%85%E4%B8%AD" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#%E5%B1%85%E4%B8%AD"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>居中</h2><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="html"><code class="language-html">&lt;center&gt;居中文字&lt;/center&gt;</code></pre><hr><h1 id="16%E6%8A%98%E5%8F%A0%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9"><a id="16%E6%8A%98%E5%8F%A0%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#16%E6%8A%98%E5%8F%A0%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>16. 折叠内容</h1><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="html"><code class="language-html">&lt;details&gt;&lt;summary&gt;点击展开&lt;/summary&gt;这里是隐藏内容&lt;/details&gt;</code></pre><p>效果：</p><details><summary>点击展开</summary><p>这里是隐藏内容</p></details><hr><h1 id="17-emoji"><a id="17-emoji" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#17-emoji"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>17. Emoji</h1><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">🚀 发布🔥 热门⚠️ 警告✅ 完成❌ 错误📌 注意</code></pre><hr><h1 id="18-mermaid%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%E5%9B%BE"><a id="18-mermaid%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%E5%9B%BE" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#18-mermaid%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%E5%9B%BE"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>18. Mermaid流程图</h1><div class="mermaid-wrap"><pre class="mermaid-src" hidden="">flowchart LRA[用户] --&gt; B[API网关]B --&gt; C[AI模型]C --&gt; D[返回结果]</pre></div><hr><h1 id="19-mermaid%E6%97%B6%E5%BA%8F%E5%9B%BE"><a id="19-mermaid%E6%97%B6%E5%BA%8F%E5%9B%BE" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#19-mermaid%E6%97%B6%E5%BA%8F%E5%9B%BE"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>19. Mermaid时序图</h1><div class="mermaid-wrap"><pre class="mermaid-src" hidden="">sequenceDiagram用户-&gt;&gt;网关: 请求网关-&gt;&gt;模型: 转发模型--&gt;&gt;网关: 返回网关--&gt;&gt;用户: 响应</pre></div><hr><h1 id="20-mermaid%E6%9E%B6%E6%9E%84%E5%9B%BE"><a id="20-mermaid%E6%9E%B6%E6%9E%84%E5%9B%BE" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#20-mermaid%E6%9E%B6%E6%9E%84%E5%9B%BE"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>20. Mermaid架构图</h1><div class="mermaid-wrap"><pre class="mermaid-src" hidden="">graph TDA[客户端]B[安全网关]C[AI模型]D[数据库]A --&gt; BB --&gt; CB --&gt; D</pre></div><hr><h1 id="21%E8%84%9A%E6%B3%A8"><a id="21%E8%84%9A%E6%B3%A8" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#21%E8%84%9A%E6%B3%A8"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>21. 脚注</h1><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">这里是一句话说明[^1][^1]: 这里是脚注内容</code></pre><hr><h1 id="22%E9%94%9A%E7%82%B9%E8%B7%B3%E8%BD%AC"><a id="22%E9%94%9A%E7%82%B9%E8%B7%B3%E8%BD%AC" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#22%E9%94%9A%E7%82%B9%E8%B7%B3%E8%BD%AC"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>22. 锚点跳转</h1><p>定义：</p><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="html"><code class="language-html">&lt;a name="top"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;</code></pre><p>跳转：</p><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">[返回顶部](#top)</code></pre><hr><h1 id="23%E9%94%AE%E7%9B%98%E6%8C%89%E9%94%AE"><a id="23%E9%94%AE%E7%9B%98%E6%8C%89%E9%94%AE" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#23%E9%94%AE%E7%9B%98%E6%8C%89%E9%94%AE"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>23. 键盘按键</h1><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="html"><code class="language-html">&lt;kbd&gt;Ctrl&lt;/kbd&gt; + &lt;kbd&gt;C&lt;/kbd&gt;</code></pre><p>效果：</p><p><kbd>Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>C</kbd></p><hr><h1 id="24%E6%8F%90%E7%A4%BA%E5%9D%97"><a id="24%E6%8F%90%E7%A4%BA%E5%9D%97" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#24%E6%8F%90%E7%A4%BA%E5%9D%97"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>24. 提示块</h1><p>部分编辑器支持：</p><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">&gt; [!NOTE]&gt; 注意内容&gt; [!WARNING]&gt; 警告内容&gt; [!TIP]&gt; 技巧内容</code></pre><hr><h1 id="25-hexo%E6%96%87%E7%AB%A0%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF"><a id="25-hexo%E6%96%87%E7%AB%A0%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#25-hexo%E6%96%87%E7%AB%A0%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>25. Hexo文章模板</h1><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="yaml"><code class="language-yaml">---title: 我的技术文章date: 2026-08-04categories:  - 技术tags:  - Docker  - Linuxcover: /images/demo.png---# 标题## 简介文章说明。## 环境| 软件 | 版本 ||-|-|| Ubuntu | 24.04 || Docker | 28.0 |## 安装```bashdocker pull nginx</code></pre><h2 id="%E6%9E%B6%E6%9E%84"><a id="%E6%9E%B6%E6%9E%84" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#%E6%9E%B6%E6%9E%84"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>架构</h2><div class="mermaid-wrap"><pre class="mermaid-src" hidden="">flowchart LRA--&gt;B--&gt;C</pre></div><h2 id="%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93"><a id="%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>总结</h2><ul><li>优点</li><li>缺点</li><li>注意事项</li></ul><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="plain_text"><code class="language-plain_text">---# 常用快捷符号| 功能 | Markdown ||-|-|| 标题 | `#` || 加粗 | `**文字**` || 斜体 | `*文字*` || 删除 | `~~文字~~` || 引用 | `&gt;` || 列表 | `-` || 代码 | `` `代码` `` || 链接 | `[名称](URL)` || 图片 | `![名称](URL)` || 表格 | `|---|` || 分割线 | `---` || 任务 | `- [ ]` |</code></pre>]]></content>
      
      
